{"text":"I put it to you today that it is this system that is embodied by China that is gathering momentum amongst people in the emerging markets as the system to follow, because they believe increasingly that it is these systems that will promise the best and fastest improvement in living standards in the shortest period of time. If you will indulge me, I will spend a few moments explaining to you first why economically they have come to this belief. First of all, it's China's economic performance over the past 30 years. She's been able to produce record economic growth and meaningfully move many people out of poverty, specifically putting a meaningful dent in poverty by moving over 300 million people out of indigence.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.7},{"text":"put","start":0.7,"end":0.96},{"text":"it","start":0.96,"end":1.14},{"text":"to","start":1.14,"end":1.32},{"text":"you","start":1.32,"end":1.44},{"text":"today","start":1.44,"end":1.74},{"text":"that","start":1.74,"end":1.94},{"text":"it","start":1.94,"end":2.08},{"text":"is","start":2.08,"end":2.28},{"text":"this","start":2.28,"end":2.54},{"text":"system","start":2.54,"end":3.06},{"text":"that","start":3.06,"end":3.4},{"text":"is","start":3.4,"end":3.52},{"text":"embodied","start":3.52,"end":3.88},{"text":"by","start":3.88,"end":4.22},{"text":"China","start":4.22,"end":4.64},{"text":"that","start":4.64,"end":5.26},{"text":"is","start":5.26,"end":5.42},{"text":"gathering","start":5.42,"end":5.9},{"text":"momentum","start":5.9,"end":6.4},{"text":"amongst","start":6.4,"end":6.78},{"text":"people","start":6.78,"end":7.12},{"text":"in","start":7.12,"end":7.32},{"text":"the","start":7.32,"end":7.4},{"text":"emerging","start":7.4,"end":7.72},{"text":"markets","start":7.72,"end":8.18},{"text":"as","start":8.18,"end":8.52},{"text":"the","start":8.52,"end":8.7},{"text":"system","start":8.7,"end":8.98},{"text":"to","start":8.98,"end":9.18},{"text":"follow","start":9.18,"end":9.54,"punct":","},{"text":"becaus